# Records summary

The retention period for financial records is five (5) years after the end of the financial year [[cite:obs-abe3f42b1fb1d22d1e3076dd56fb57b72a2622fd "Financial records are retained for five (5) years after the end of the financial year."]].

Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore [[cite:obs-b14f93dd0358ad717d10ba06abc4bb7e00110a1c "Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore."]].
